{
  "_readme": [
    "mode: \"full\" respects every tool's own enabled flag below.",
    "mode: \"read_only\" force-disables every \"write\" tool regardless of its enabled flag",
    "  (read tools still respect their own flag). Fastest way to lock the account down.",
    "Per-tool: {\"type\": \"read\"|\"write\", \"enabled\": true|false}.",
    "After editing, run:  node apply-tools.js",
    "That rewrites ~/.claude.json (backing it up first).",
    "Fully restart the Claude app afterwards for changes to take effect."
